      <cyrillic>зүв</cyrillic>
      <transcript>ZYB</transcript>
      <definition>intensifying adverbial particle before adj. and adv. beginning with the syllable zy.</definition>
      <page>1082</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠵᠥᠪ ᠵᠦᠭᠡᠷ᠎ᠡ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- zyger-e</transcript>
          <definition>Quite all right, just fine.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠵᠥᠪ ᠵᠦᠭᠡᠷ᠎ᠡ ᠰᠠᠭᠤᠬᠤ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- zyger-e saγuxu</transcript>
          <definition>To do nothing; to be idle.</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
